s for their own investigations and experiments, with counterevidence and limitations updated to distinguish what is now executed from what is still derived. Incomplete: the parent's own knowledge-correction gap ebbec352695d43beb398bb1b239cda41-gap-5 was not answered this turn because answering it needs a rewrite of the long parent account, and the forwarded-compaction, direct-range-read and forwarded-Compaction-to-NoSnapshot variants still need harness work.\"}"}}
